# HHT_TEMPLATE_PLACEHOLDER — replace all [[PLACEHOLDER ...]] copy before preflight.
# Core variables: {{publisherName}}, {{contactName}}, {{articleTitle}}, {{articleUrl}},
# {{rankingKeyword}}, {{serpPosition}}, {{city}}, {{state}}, {{targetHhtUrl}},
# {{secondaryHhtUrl}}, {{insertionSuggestion}}, {{guestPostRequirements}}.
# Personalized guest-post variables: {{pitchTopics}}, {{fitLine}}, {{subjectLine}}.
# Structured guideline variables: {{submissionMethod}}, {{submissionUrl}},
# {{pitchTopicCount}}, {{pitchContentStage}}, {{requiredSubjectLineFormat}},
# {{acceptedTopics}}, {{excludedTopics}}, {{wordCount}}, {{linkPolicy}},
# {{samplesRequired}}, {{bioRequired}}, {{aiContentPolicy}}, {{paidOrSponsored}},
# {{guidelineEvidence}}.
# Empty fallback: every missing variable renders as an empty string. No subject is rendered.
# The rendered body must remain under 1,000 characters.
[[PLACEHOLDER guest-post contact-form body.
{{contactName}} / {{publisherName}}
{{articleTitle}} {{articleUrl}}
{{rankingKeyword}} {{serpPosition}}
{{city}} {{state}}
{{targetHhtUrl}} {{secondaryHhtUrl}}
{{insertionSuggestion}}
{{guestPostRequirements}}]]
